[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]　•  三国时代入选7人：张辽、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "关羽", "cat": "people"}]关羽[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "张飞", "cat": "people"}]张飞[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "邓艾", "cat": "people"}]邓艾[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "周瑜", "cat": "people"}]周瑜[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "陆逊", "cat": "people"}]陆逊[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "吕蒙", "cat": "people"}]吕蒙[/url][/color][/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]　•  原因推断：唐人选将重独立统帅能力，[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "合肥之战", "cat": "events"}]合肥之战[/url][/color]中张辽居功首位，李典以辅助身份参战，且英年早逝（36岁）功绩年限短，故未入选——属学理判断，非正史明言[/indent]
